Package: RADTE
Type: Package
Title: Relatively and Absolutely Dating Tree Events
Version: 0.6.3
Authors@R: person("Kenji", "Fukushima", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "kfuku52@gmail.com")
Description: Infers absolute ages of gene duplication and speciation events by
    combining reconciled gene trees with dated species trees. The repository
    also distributes a generated, self-contained command-line script.
License: file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/kfuku52/RADTE
BugReports: https://github.com/kfuku52/RADTE/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports:
    ape
Suggests:
    covr,
    lintr,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    treeio
Config/testthat/edition: 3
SystemRequirements: PAML (optional, for the MCMCTree backend)
